g in the streets of London. How can he redeem himself? In love, he will find the resources to surpass himself in the face of great danger…","tagline":"For dog's sake!"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6hD2mWiOpaq0wezfHTxt7hUn3Q5.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3EfhschqkWcT4WH7aowAd5d0aen.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":509730,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6hD2mWiOpaq0wezfHTxt7hUn3Q5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6hD2mWiOpaq0wezfHTxt7hUn3Q5.jpg","language":"it","width":1900,"height":2850},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6hD2mWiOpaq0wezfHTxt7hUn3Q5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6hD2mWiOpaq0wezfHTxt7hUn3Q5.jpg","language":"it","width":1900,"height":2850},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dY59XyVcQ6yNR7Srq9vJCc9kFIJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dY59XyVcQ6yNR7Srq9vJCc9kFIJ.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xcl4vYTqqzwn3ihUpjCQz0jqhV3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xcl4vYTqqzwn3ihUpjCQz0jqhV3.jpg","language":"en","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xcl4vYTqqzwn3ihUpjCQz0jqhV3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xcl4vYTqqzwn3ihUpjCQz0jqhV3.jpg","language":"en","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/joQd96pzwYEy39E3qvfE1I9Y6sU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/joQd96pzwYEy39E3qvfE1I9Y6sU.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/origin